<title>INDIA: India's 96/97 fertiliser output falls.</title>
<headline>India's 96/97 fertiliser output falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 8.60 million tonnes of nitrogenous fertilisers in 1996/97 (April-March) compared with 8.78 million in 1995/96, the government said in its monthly economic report on Saturday.</p>
<p>The country produced 2.56 million tonnes of phosphatic ferlilisers in 1996/97, the same as last year, the report said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91011 301 2024</p>
</text>
